			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 205060101,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}好，我是煉金術的研究者蒂瑪烏斯，歡迎來到蒙德城。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂瑪烏斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060102,
					"content": "煉金術？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205060103,
					"content": "這是一種從古代流傳下來的技術，目前我們還對它瞭解甚少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂瑪烏斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060104,
					"content": "它的規則神秘而奇妙，和我們所知的創造物體的原理完全不同。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂瑪烏斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060105,
					"content": "要是能掌握這門技術，我們應該就能造出很不得了的東西了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂瑪烏斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060106,
					"content": "這邊的這個就是煉金術用的檯子吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060107,
					"content": "沒錯。對了，要不要親自使用一下煉金術看看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060108,
						205060109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂瑪烏斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060108,
					"content": "聽起來很複雜，沒問題嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205060110,
					"content": "#沒事的，至少操作上並不複雜。{F#妳}{M#你}有興趣的話我可以教{F#妳}{M#你}最基礎的部分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂瑪烏斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 205060111,
					"content": "煉金合成",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 205060109,
					"content": "會爆炸吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205060110
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2050602,
			"completionStepIds": [
